# Fix Admin Panel Implementation Plan

Currently, the Admin Panel has a functional Dashboard, User Management, and Smart Contract Status. However, the Products, Orders, Analytics, and Settings pages are placeholder `div`s. 

This plan details the steps to fully construct the missing Administrative features.

## Open Questions
> [!NOTE]
> Since the platform uses the blockchain for Order Escrow, do you want the Admin Order Management to have the ability to "Force Refund" or "Force Release" funds from the smart contract, or should the admin just be able to *view* the orders? (I will assume *viewing* with basic status overriding for now).

